WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.528
Step 1. In the Responses section, select Respond.

1.2
00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:06.538
You answer the referral with a response form,

1.3
00:00:06.538 --> 00:00:10.249
and you can complete the referral when you save.

2.1
00:00:10.249 --> 00:00:12.318
Step 2. Choose the form.

2.2
00:00:12.318 --> 00:00:17.366
When there is only one response form, Care shows it at once.

3.1
00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:23.455
Step 3. Answer the questions of the form. A red asterisk marks a required question.

3.2
00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:26.551
To read the referral and its shared records,

3.3
00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:32.103
open the Referral and shared records tab.

4.1
00:00:32.103 --> 00:00:36.788
Step 5. Select Save response and complete at the bottom right.

4.2
00:00:36.788 --> 00:00:41.008
Care saves your answers and sets the referral to Completed.

4.3
00:00:41.008 --> 00:00:45.012
To save without completing, select Save response.
